{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54676","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相鬭（京本作「闻」）敌，日鬬对城营（京本作「营城」）。\n交战血流看主客，必应主败客军赢，日度算还生。\n（辛本、川本注：「算太阳分野。\n」京本注：「精算太阳分野，在日度算还生第十三首。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}